<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-Treasury details OLOs for exchange auctions.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Treasury details OLOs for exchange auctions.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said the</p>
<p>following linear government bonds (OLOs) would be offered at the</p>
<p>August 5 exchange auction -</p>
<p>code 287 OLO 27  4.00 pct, 22 Jan 00</p>
<p>code 259 OLO 10  8.75 pct, 25 Jun 02</p>
<p>code 273 OLO 19  6.50 pct, 31 Mar 05</p>
<p>code 268 OLO 16  7.50 pct, 29 Jul 08</p>
<p>NOTE - in exchange for code 254 OLO  8  9.25 pct, 29 Aug 97 and</p>
<p>code 248 OLO  4  9.25 pct, 02 Jan 98.</p>
<p>and at the August 19 exchange auction -</p>
<p>code 287 OLO 27  4.00 pct, 22 Jan 00</p>
<p>code 285 OLO 25  5.00 pct, 28 Mar 01</p>
<p>code 251 OLO  6  9.00 pct, 28 Mar 03</p>
<p>code 265 OLO 14  7.25 pct, 29 Apr 04</p>
<p>code 257 OLO  9  8.50 pct, 01 Oct 07</p>
<p>NOTE - in exchange for code 260 OLO 11  9.00 pct, 30 Jul 98</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
